{"title":"Pierre Pinson","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Pierre Pinson","body-classes":"home","pagetitle":"Pierre Pinson – Forecasting, analytics and decision sciences","page-layout":"full","aliases":["/index.php/index.html"],"listing":[{"id":"recent-pubs","contents":"publications.yml","template":"_templates/pubs-compact.ejs","max-items":6,"sort":false},{"id":"recent-news","contents":"news/posts","type":"table","fields":["date","title"],"sort":"date desc","max-items":3,"date-format":"MMM YYYY","filter-ui":false,"sort-ui":false}]},"headingText":"Recent publications","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div>\n    <h1>Making uncertainty useful.</h1>\n    <p class=\"roles\"><strong>Principal</strong> at <a href=\"https://incommodities.com/\">inCommodities</a> and <strong>Professor</strong> at Imperial College London, Dyson School of Design Engineering</p>\n    <p class=\"lede\">I work on probabilistic forecasting, forecast verification and electricity markets, combining statistics and operations research to get the most value out of data.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <a class=\"btn-pp primary\" href=\"publications.html\">Read the publications</a>\n      <a class=\"btn-pp\" href=\"teaching/index.html\">Take the open course</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <figure class=\"fan-wrap\">\n    <svg id=\"fan\" class=\"fan\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 230\" role=\"img\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Interactive probabilistic forecast. Move the pointer or use the arrow keys to issue a forecast from a different time.\">\n      <path class=\"band b1\" opacity=\".16\" d=\"M160 128 C220 72 300 58 400 40 L400 222 C300 210 220 190 160 128Z\"/>\n      <path class=\"band b2\" opacity=\".3\" d=\"M160 128 C220 96 300 90 400 80 L400 192 C300 180 220 166 160 128Z\"/>\n      <path class=\"band b3\" opacity=\".55\" d=\"M160 128 C220 114 300 116 400 114 L400 156 C300 150 220 144 160 128Z\"/>\n      <path class=\"obs\" d=\"M0 150 C30 142 50 160 80 148 C110 136 130 150 160 128\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <figcaption class=\"fan-caption\"><span class=\"k k-obs\">Observed</span><span class=\"k k-band\">Predictive intervals</span><span class=\"k k-truth\">What happened next</span></figcaption>\n    <p class=\"fan-hint\">Move across the chart to forecast from another moment.</p>\n  </figure>\n</section>\n```\n\n{{< include _home_themes.md >}}\n\n::: {.home-cols}\n::: {}\n\n::: {#recent-pubs}\n:::\n\n[All 220 publications](publications.qmd) · [Download BibTeX](files/pinson-publications.bib)\n:::\n\n::: {}\n## Open course\n\n::: {.course-feature}\n### Renewables in Electricity Markets\n\nTen modules of video lectures and slides, from market fundamentals to advanced renewable energy forecasting, with exercises and interviews.\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"progress-ticks\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n```\n\n[Start with module 1](teaching/module-01.qmd){.btn-pp .primary}\n:::\n\n## News\n\n::: {#recent-news}\n:::\n:::\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div>\n    <h1>Making uncertainty useful.</h1>\n    <p class=\"roles\"><strong>Principal</strong> at <a href=\"https://incommodities.com/\">inCommodities</a> and <strong>Professor</strong> at Imperial College London, Dyson School of Design Engineering</p>\n    <p class=\"lede\">I work on probabilistic forecasting, forecast verification and electricity markets, combining statistics and operations research to get the most value out of data.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <a class=\"btn-pp primary\" href=\"publications.html\">Read the publications</a>\n      <a class=\"btn-pp\" href=\"teaching/index.html\">Take the open course</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <figure class=\"fan-wrap\">\n    <svg id=\"fan\" class=\"fan\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 230\" role=\"img\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Interactive probabilistic forecast. Move the pointer or use the arrow keys to issue a forecast from a different time.\">\n      <path class=\"band b1\" opacity=\".16\" d=\"M160 128 C220 72 300 58 400 40 L400 222 C300 210 220 190 160 128Z\"/>\n      <path class=\"band b2\" opacity=\".3\" d=\"M160 128 C220 96 300 90 400 80 L400 192 C300 180 220 166 160 128Z\"/>\n      <path class=\"band b3\" opacity=\".55\" d=\"M160 128 C220 114 300 116 400 114 L400 156 C300 150 220 144 160 128Z\"/>\n      <path class=\"obs\" d=\"M0 150 C30 142 50 160 80 148 C110 136 130 150 160 128\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <figcaption class=\"fan-caption\"><span class=\"k k-obs\">Observed</span><span class=\"k k-band\">Predictive intervals</span><span class=\"k k-truth\">What happened next</span></figcaption>\n    <p class=\"fan-hint\">Move across the chart to forecast from another moment.</p>\n  </figure>\n</section>\n```\n\n{{< include _home_themes.md >}}\n\n::: {.home-cols}\n::: {}\n## Recent publications\n\n::: {#recent-pubs}\n:::\n\n[All 220 publications](publications.qmd) · [Download BibTeX](files/pinson-publications.bib)\n:::\n\n::: {}\n## Open course\n\n::: {.course-feature}\n### Renewables in Electricity Markets\n\nTen modules of video lectures and slides, from market fundamentals to advanced renewable energy forecasting, with exercises and interviews.\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"progress-ticks\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n```\n\n[Start with module 1](teaching/module-01.qmd){.btn-pp .primary}\n:::\n\n## News\n\n::: {#recent-news}\n:::\n:::\n:::\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"in